# DISPLACE bisect 2: does the Quality ViewDistance switch hide the probe's meshes?
Дано run Scene "Open Scene DISPLACE_Probe.desce"
Тогда d0_default probe as opened: slab, ground, CesiumMan visible
Когда run Quality "Quality: ViewDistance Cinematic"
Тогда d1_cinematic same view after ViewDistance Cinematic
Когда run Quality "Quality: ViewDistance Low"
Тогда d2_low same view after ViewDistance Low
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,60,520
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.22,-1
Тогда d3_cam view after the camera set
